## Streaming Protocol

Switched from plain-text to **NDJSON** (newline-delimited JSON):

```
{ "type": "token",       "content": "..." }
{ "type": "interrupt",   "data": {...} }
{ "type": "plan",        "steps": [...] }
{ "type": "step_status", "step": "...", "status": "running" }
{ "type": "done" }
```

